            </ol>
            <p class="cs-onboard-foot">
              Agents onboard the same way. An MCP token is read-only unless you grant more, and
              secret values stay masked unless the token carries <code>secrets:reveal</code>. You can
              hand an agent the whole operating surface without handing it a single secret.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

